#. 苗木よ、我は…
msgctxt "0001 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Makoto, I..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0002 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. いや、なんでもない…
#. それより何か用か？
msgctxt "0003 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Actually, never mind. So, what did you want?"
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0004 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Sakura"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうしよう？
#. 大神さんを誘ってみようか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Should I talk to Sakura for a while?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木よ、お主は男子の割には、
#. 少し線が細過ぎるようだな…
msgctxt "0007 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "You know, Makoto... You seem a little thin, for a man."
msgstr ""

#. どれ、少し稽古をつけてやるか…
msgctxt "0008 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "How about I help you bulk up a bit?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大神さんから、
#. 稽古という名のしごきを受けた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sakura subjected me to a harsh, borderline cruel\n"
"training session...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大神さんと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sakura and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Sakura a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
